{
  "_comment": "Hand-maintained input for cmd/geo-gen. CI (.github/workflows/geo-update.yml) runs the generator daily: it fetches the upstreams below, validates every line through config.ClassifyRouteEntry (the same gate the router applies), dedupes/sorts/caps, and rewrites presets/*.lst + presets/manifest.json. Do not edit the generated files by hand. ga_tags is a candidate list -- the first id present in the current Geo-Aggregator catalog wins, so an upstream rename degrades to 'preset skipped' instead of a failed build. To add a service: copy a row, set name/title/category, point ga_tags at a Geo-Aggregator service id (see its db/catalog.json), and add cidr_providers only when the lord-alfred/ipranges provider block is genuinely that service's own infra and reasonably small (content/app services, not whole clouds).",

  "geo_aggregator_catalog": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ground-Zerro/Geo-Aggregator/main/db/catalog.json",
  "ipranges_base": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lord-alfred/ipranges/main",

  "max_domains": 200,
  "max_cidrs": 250,
  "min_keep": 8,
  "drift_gate_low": 0.5,
  "drift_gate_high": 2.0,

